<title>USA: CCC buys 3,000 T soybean meal for Georgia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 3,000 T soybean meal for Georgia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 3,000 tonnes soybean meal under the export donation program for Georgia.</p>
<p>The meal was acquired at $316.83 a tonne, FOB, Darrow, La., from Continental Grain for October 10-November 5 shipment.</p>
<p>Total value of the sale was $950,490.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
